### Get access token
POST {{URL}}/security/generate-token HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "grant_type": "password",
  "client_id": "frontend",
  "client_secret": "frontend",
  "scope": "api",
  "username": "test@dotkernel.com",
  "password": "dotkernel"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.access_token);
%}

### Get user by UUID
GET {{URL}}/warehouses
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get user by UUID
GET {{URL}}/warehouse/65656662-3036-3566-2d32-3336302d3131
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
